      "id": "claim_396d990889144e2cbefe1c93b616197b",
      "statement": "Graph construction builds a core stack of filesystem, optional synchronous subagents, parent notification, summarization, tool-call repair, and optional asynchronous subagents; profile middleware, optional skills, provider caching, optional memory, HITL, and unsupported-content filtering form the tail. Profile exclusions run before and after caller middleware merge, and profile-controlled tool exclusion is appended last.",
